     "html": "<p>The steps whose sign the told list names and whose sign is actually there: a document that came across, a meeting with the person the step needs, a date somebody named. One per step, matched to the sign you said to look for and to nothing else. Which records it needs and when the number stops meaning anything are not written in the count's fields yet, like every other count.</p>\n<p>It counts within <a href=\"../assemblies/buying-process.md\"><code>buying-process</code></a>.</p>"
