   "markdown": "---\nid: field\nfamily: reply\nlabel: A field\nblurb: One thing only you know, typed.\nshape: a single field and Next, grey until there is an answer\n---\n\n# A field\n\n## What it shows\n\nThe reply for one fact only you hold, like a name, a date or a sentence in your words.\n\n## Row form\n\nNo rows. The placeholder comes from the card's `reply.placeholder`.\n"
